# DESK03 -- the Options drop-down in both selection states (men_update gating).
#   "Remove desktop icon" is entry 4; EmuTOS disables it iff ndesk == 0
#   (deskmain.c:540-542). "Install icon"/"Install devices" are never disabled.
#   NOTE the click order: the first click after a drop-down is open is eaten by
#   the AES menu tracker (it dismisses the menu), so the icon is selected
#   BEFORE the bar is touched, and the deselect click is preceded by a
#   dismissing one.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 38 39
1700 down
1703 up
1900 move 600 240
2300 mark B_SELECTED
2600 move 196 8
3300 mark C_OPTIONS_SEL
3600 move 400 300
3800 down
3803 up
4100 move 400 300
4300 down
4303 up
4500 move 600 240
5000 mark D_DESELECTED
5300 move 196 8
6000 mark E_OPTIONS_NOSEL
